[[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238400\">5510C16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237458\">1016A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237496\">1032C32</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237492\">1032B55</a></p><p>Undo the bolts and remove the rear left\ntiming belt guard.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the left cylinder head (1b) camshaft\nfront caps.</p><p>2. Remove the left cylinder head camshaft front oil seals.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013497.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the camshaft front cap and fix it tightening the bolts to\nthe recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CAMSHAFT CAPS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.8 - 2.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Fit the new oil seals for the left cylinder head camshafts (1a)\nusing the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.948.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013498.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>Fit the timing belt rear left guard and\nfix it using the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237492\">1032B55</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237496\">1032C32</a></p><p>Carry out op.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3237557\">1072B50</a></p><p>Carry out op.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238401\">5510C18</a></p><p>Carry out op.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3237459\">1016A34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237460\">1016A36</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237557\">1072B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p>"]]